\b AstroPhoto - installation information\b0\par\par
Installs AstroPhoto for the current Windows user, with a Start menu shortcut. No administrator rights are required for the default location.\par\par
Camera support uses Canon EDSDK. Third-party components remain subject to their respective terms; notices are included in the licenses folder. This installer does not grant additional rights to redistribute Canon software.\par\par
Settings and captured images are stored beside the application. Uninstall removes installed program files and leaves user-created settings and images. Choose a writable installation folder.\par
